        "nobel_worthiness": "CAR-T therapy established a powerful therapeutic principle: genetically redirecting a patient's immune cells to treat otherwise refractory cancer.",
        "attribution": "The named investigators made distinct, mutually reinforcing contributions to adoptive cell therapy and engineered antigen-receptor approaches.",
        "maturity": "Durable clinical responses, approved therapies, and continuing extension of the platform provide substantial maturity.",
        "uncertainties": [
