        "attribution": "The three listed scientists constitute a recognizable and limited group for the positional-cloning and molecular-identification achievement.",
        "maturity": "The gene's role, molecular physiology, diagnostic significance, and downstream therapeutic consequences have been extensively confirmed.",
        "uncertainties": [
