        "nobel_worthiness": "BCR-ABL inhibition established a compelling model for molecularly targeted cancer therapy and radically improved chronic myeloid leukemia treatment.",
        "attribution": "Lydon's drug-development contribution, Druker's clinical translation, and Sawyers's work on disease biology and resistance give a credible three-person account.",
        "maturity": "The therapeutic principle has long clinical validation and reshaped oncology drug development.",
